{"date":"Wednesday 25 November 2026","updated":"10:00","sub":"Wednesday 25 November 2026 · GBP/USD. Watches the London killzone so you do not have to trade it: a map at 06:40, the leg and its equilibrium at 10:00, a scorecard at noon. It never calls a trade.","feed":"<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">06:40<small>Morning map</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--blue)\">Morning map</span><h2>The nearest real draw is the Asia high, 38 pips above.</h2><p class=\"lede\">Before London opens, this is where the resting orders are and how often price has gone to get them by noon.</p><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD · 1.30776</strong><span class=\"side map\">DRAW MAP</span></header><div class=\"pools\"><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Last week's low<small>1.30757 · 1.9p below</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:0%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">n/a</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Asia high<small>1.31161 · 38.5p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:19%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">19%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Yesterday's high<small>1.31249 · 47.3p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:4%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">4%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Yesterday's low<small>1.30295 · 48.1p below</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:2%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">2%</div></div><div class=\"pool\"><div class=\"nm\">Last week's high<small>1.32283 · 150.7p above</small></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"--p:0%\"></i></div><div class=\"odds\">0%</div></div></div></div><p>Nearest draw of 10 pips or more: GBP/USD Asia high 1.31161 (38 pips, 19% reached historically); EUR/USD previous week low 1.09537 (19 pips, 32%). Times unverified today: the feed-clock check was ambiguous, and the economic calendar could not be fetched.</p><p class=\"dim\">Watching only. Handover at 10:00.</p><section class=\"stage\" aria-label=\"Session chart\"><header><div><strong id=\"cPair\"></strong><small>15m · UK time</small></div><div class=\"views\" id=\"views\"></div></header>\n<svg class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Candlestick chart of the session with the desk's levels\"></svg><div class=\"pdk\" id=\"pdk\"></div><div class=\"scap\" id=\"cap\"></div></section></div></article>\n<article class=\"post\"><div class=\"time\">10:00<small>Handover</small></div><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\" style=\"--k:var(--copper)\">Killzone handover</span><h2>A 28-pip leg down. Equilibrium is 1.30723.</h2><div class=\"plan\"><header><strong>GBP/USD</strong><span class=\"side map\">HANDOVER</span></header><dl><dt>Leg</dt><dd><span class=\"px \">1.30865</span> at 07:15 → <span class=\"px \">1.30581</span> at 09:55 · 28.4 pips down</dd><dt>Equilibrium</dt><dd><span class=\"px c\">1.30723</span> · 13.4 pips above price · returns by noon on <b>65%</b> of sessions</dd><dt>Swept</dt><dd>Asia low <span class=\"px \">1.30774</span>, 2 pips past</dd></dl></div><p>GBP/USD pushed down through the killzone, gave up its Asia low and sits about 13 pips under the leg's midpoint. EUR/USD only tagged its Asia low, bounced and is back on its midpoint, so the two pairs disagree on the sell-side (SMT). Unspent: the GBP/USD previous day low below and the EUR/USD previous week low above; times unverified today.</p></div></article>","week":"<section class=\"week\"><h3>Meridian 2 · week of 23 Nov · equilibrium reached by noon</h3><div class=\"wk\"><div class=\"\"><small>Mon</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Tue</small><b class=\"r\">no</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Wed</small><b class=\"\">live</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Thu</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"\"><small>Fri</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div><div class=\"tot\"><small>Week</small><b class=\"\">—</b></div></div></section>","chart":{"pair":"GBP/USD","bars":[["00:00",1.3111